<title>UK: IADB sets $500 mln five-year bond, eight b.p. over.</title>
<headline>IADB sets $500 mln five-year bond, eight b.p. over.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER-AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    27.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    27.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIP     NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PERCENT U.S. TREASURY DUE 31.JUL.01 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
